{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — bespoke aromatherapy that may support calm, rest, focus, and creative ease." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfaf9; --ink:#192227; --muted:#6b7a7a; --accent:#8fbf9b; --accent-2:#f2c57c; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --round:14px; --card-pad:18px; --maxw:980px;
      --brand-font: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;font-family:var(--brand-font);color:var(--ink);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbfbfc 0%,#f6fbf7 100%);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;line-height:1.4}
    .wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:36px auto;padding:28px}

    /* Header / Nav */
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    .brand h1{font-size:16px;margin:0}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px;font-weight:600}

    /* Hero */
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;align-items:start;margin-bottom:22px}
    .hero-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.75), rgba(255,255,255,0.6));border-radius:var(--round);padding:26px;box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(25,34,39,0.06);backdrop-filter: blur(6px);}
    .lead{font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);margin:0 0 8px}
    .sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}
    .contact-grid{display:grid;gap:12px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Mood-to-Method */
    .mood{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .mood-controls{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood-btn{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(25,34,39,0.06);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:12px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:var(--ink);transition:all .22s}
    .mood-btn[data-active="true"]{background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;border:0;transform:translateY(-2px)}
    .result{padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.7), rgba(255,255,255,0.55));display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start}
    .pill{background:var(--glass);padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700;font-size:13px}
    .approach h3{margin:0 0 6px}
    .approach p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .comparator{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .switch{display:inline-flex;background:rgba(25,34,39,0.05);border-radius:999px;padding:4px}
    .switch button{padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;border:0;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .switch button[data-active="true"]{background:white;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(25,34,39,0.06)}
    .prices{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:baseline}
    .price{font-size:22px;font-weight:800}
    .unit{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}

    /* Form */
    form{display:grid;gap:12px}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(25,34,39,0.06);font-size:15px}
    textarea{min-height:110px}
    .submit{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}

    /* small layout */
    .side-cta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Footer */
    footer{margin-top:34px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px dashed rgba(25,34,39,0.04);color:var(--muted);display:flex;justify-content:space-between}

    /* Decorative pattern (unique inline SVG usage) */
    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;right:0;top:20%;opacity:0.08;pointer-events:none}
    .card-quiet{background:linear-gradient(180deg, #ffffff, #fefefe);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(25,34,39,0.04)}

    @media (max-width:880px){
      .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .pattern-wrap{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pattern-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- Unique SVG pattern (an abstract leaf-spiral weave). This inline SVG replaces assets/img/pattern.svg for portability. -->
    <svg width="220" height="220" viewBox="0 0 220 220" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#8fbf9b" />
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#f2c57c" />
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      <g opacity="0.95">
        <path d="M110 12c22 0 38 18 38 40s-16 40-38 40-38-18-38-40S88 12 110 12z" fill="url(#g1)" opacity="0.35"/>
        <path d="M110 62c32 0 58 26 58 58s-26 58-58 58-58-26-58-58 26-58 58-58z" stroke="#8fbf9b" stroke-opacity="0.12" stroke-width="8" fill="none"/>
        <g transform="rotate(24 110 110)">
          <path d="M110 0c18 0 34 14 34 32s-16 32-34 32-34-14-34-32S92 0 110 0z" fill="#ffffff" opacity="0.06"/>
        </g>
        <circle cx="165" cy="165" r="18" fill="#f2c57c" opacity="0.08"/>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo">A</div>
        <div>
          <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
          <div class="muted">Scent-guided practices that may support small shifts</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Personal Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Boutique</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
        <a href="about.html">Gather</a>
        <a href="book.html">Book</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <p class="lead">Tell us a little about what you need today</p>
          <p class="sub">We craft scent-led approaches that may support moments of rest, focus, or gentle release — tailored to everyday life.</p>

          <div class="mood">
            <div class="muted">Choose how you’re feeling — we’ll suggest a method and tune your next step</div>
            <div class="mood-controls" role="tablist" aria-label="Mood selector">
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="stressed">Tight / Stressed</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="restless">Too Wired</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="foggy">Foggy / Distracted</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="sadder">Low / Heavy</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="restful">Seeking Rest</button>
            </div>

            <div class="result" id="moodResult" aria-live="polite">
              <div class="pill" id="approachType">Gentle Ritual</div>
              <div class="approach">
                <h3 id="approachTitle">A calm breathing scent ritual</h3>
                <p id="approachDesc">Choose a cooling citrus-wood blend, 2–3 gentle inhalations, and a 5-minute grounding breath sequence. This may support a clearer headspace.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
              <a id="moodCta" class="submit" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
              <div class="small muted">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="side-cta">
          <div class="card-quiet">
            <div class="muted">Compare access</div>
            <div class="comparator">
              <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
                <div class="muted">Pricing view</div>
                <div class="switch" role="tablist" aria-label="Pricing type">
                  <button data-type="monthly" data-active="true">Monthly</button>
                  <button data-type="package">Package</button>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="prices">
                <div>
                  <div class="muted">Starter Path</div>
                  <div class="price"><span id="starterPrice">$48</span><span class="unit">/mo</span></div>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <div class="muted">Deep Tune</div>
                  <div class="price"><span id="tunePrice">$240</span><span class="unit">/mo</span></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Toggle to see per-month or per-package framing. Numbers animate when switching.</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card-quiet">
            <div class="muted">Quick contact</div>
            <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">Prefer a quick message? Use the form.</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:20px;margin-top:18px">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h2 style="margin-top:0">Connect with our team</h2>
          <p class="muted">Fill in a few details and we'll respond within 48 hours. We prioritize safety and will ask about pregnancy, pets, and patch testing during booking.</p>

          <form id="contactForm" autocomplete="on">
            <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px">
              <input name="name" placeholder="Your full name" required>
              <input name="phone" placeholder="Phone (optional)">
            </div>
            <input name="email" placeholder="Email" required>
            <label class="muted">What are you hoping to support?</label>
            <select name="goal" id="goalSelect">
              <option value="rest">Rest or better sleep</option>
              <option value="calm">Reduce stress / tension</option>
              <option value="focus">Focus & clarity</option>
              <option value="blend">Create a personal blend</option>
            </select>
            <label class="muted">Message</label>
            <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us about sensitivities, pregnancy, pets in the home, or previous scent preferences"></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center">
              <button type="submit" class="submit" id="formSubmit">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <div class="muted small">Or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            </div>

            <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px;margin-top:8px">Safety note: Our guidance may support wellbeing but is not medical advice. We recommend patch testing and appropriate dilution for topical use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or have pets, please tell us — we will adapt recommendations.</div>
          </form>
        </div>

        <aside class="hero-card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick help</h3>
          <div class="muted">Call or email if your request is time-sensitive</div>
          <div style="margin-top:14px">
            <div class="muted">Phone</div>
            <div style="font-weight:800;margin-bottom:10px"><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            <div class="muted">Email</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700"><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:18px">
            <div class="muted">Locations</div>
            <div style="font-weight:700">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section style="margin-top:20px">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">FAQ — safe use & tests</h3>
          <div style="display:grid;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <div>
              <strong>Patch test</strong>
              <div class="muted">We always recommend a small patch test (diluted oil applied to inner forearm) for 24 hours to check for sensitivity.</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Dilution</strong>
              <div class="muted">Topical blends are offered at safe dilutions (commonly 1%–3% for general use). If you have a specific sensitivity, we will reduce strength.</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Pregnancy & nursing</strong>
              <div class="muted">We adapt recommendations — some essential oils are avoided in pregnancy. Please disclose if you are pregnant or nursing so we can provide safety-conscious options.</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Pets</strong>
              <div class="muted">Certain oils can be harmful to pets. Tell us about household animals and we will suggest pet-safe approaches for diffusing or topical use.</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
      <div class="muted">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — thoughtfully scented experiences.</div>
      <div class="muted">Made with care • <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Simple helpers
    const $ = s => document.querySelector(s);
    const $$ = s => document.querySelectorAll(s);

    // Mood-to-Method logic
    const moodMap = {
      stressed: {
        type: 'Breath + Cool Citrus',
        title: 'Short inhale-exhale ritual with citrus-wood',
        desc: 'A crisp citrus top-note with grounding cedar may support a quick reset: 3 gentle inhalations, followed by 5 slow breaths. Suitable for on-the-go moments.',
        ctaLabel: 'Book a quick reset',
        ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?plan=quick-reset'
      },
      restless: {
        type: 'Nightly Wind-Down',
        title: 'Evening diffusion & gentle layering',
        desc: 'A lavender-forward calming approach with soft chamomile notes. Diffuse at low setting 30–45mins before rest. May support easier sleep transitions.',
        ctaLabel: 'Start a sleep plan',
        ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?plan=sleep'
      },
      foggy: {
        type: 'Focus Ladder',
        title: 'Uplift + focus inhalation',
        desc: 'A bright mint-rosemary pairing to sharpen attention for short, focused work blocks. Use 1–2 gentle inhalations at the start of a task. May support concentration.',
        ctaLabel: 'Try a focus session',
        ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?plan=focus'
      },
      sadder: {
        type: 'Warm Ground',
        title: 'Comforting warm-spice ritual',
        desc: 'A soft blend of orange and rounded spice with a warm base may support cozy regulation. Use as a personal inhaler or a single warm diffused session.',
        ctaLabel: 'Book a comfort consult',
        ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?plan=comfort'
      },
      restful: {
        type: 'Rest Support',
        title: 'Longer calming bath or diffuser plan',
        desc: 'A gentle, low-dilution option designed for extended rest; recommended for nights when deeper sleep is needed. May support restorative rest when paired with sleep hygiene.',
        ctaLabel: 'Ask about rest options',
        ctaUrl: '{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}?plan=rest'
      }
    };

    function setActiveMood(key){
      $$('.mood-btn').forEach(b => b.dataset.active = (b.dataset.mood === key));
      const map = moodMap[key];
      if(!map) return;
      $('#approachType').textContent = map.type;
      $('#approachTitle').textContent = map.title;
      $('#approachDesc').textContent = map.desc;
      const cta = $('#moodCta');
      cta.textContent = map.ctaLabel;
      cta.href = map.ctaUrl;
    }

    // wire up mood buttons
    $$('.mood-btn').forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', e => {
        setActiveMood(btn.dataset.mood);
      });
    });

    // default
    setActiveMood('stressed');

    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    const pricing = {
      monthly: { starter: 48, tune: 240 },
      package: { starter: 240, tune: 1200 }
    };

    let currentView = 'monthly';

    function animateValue(el, start, end, duration=600){
      const startTime = performance.now();
      function tick(now){
        const elapsed = now - startTime;
        const t = Math.min(1, elapsed / duration);
        const val = Math.round(start + (end - start) * (t < 0.5 ? 2 * t * t : -1 + (4 - 2 * t) * t));
        el.textContent = '$' + val;
        if(t < 1) requestAnimationFrame(tick);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(tick);
    }

    document.querySelectorAll('.switch button').forEach(btn => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const type = btn.dataset.type;
        if(type === currentView) return;
        currentView = type;
        document.querySelectorAll('.switch button').forEach(b => b.dataset.active = (b === btn));
        // update UI labels
        const s = pricing[type];
        // animate numbers: parse current displayed value
        const curStarter = parseInt($('#starterPrice').textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''),10) || 0;
        const curTune = parseInt($('#tunePrice').textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''),10) || 0;
        animateValue($('#starterPrice'), curStarter, s.starter);
        animateValue($('#tunePrice'), curTune, s.tune);

        // update unit label
        const unitEls = document.querySelectorAll('.unit');
        unitEls.forEach(u => u.textContent = (type === 'monthly' ? '/mo' : '/package'));
      });
    });

    // Form submission (local demo only)
    $('#contactForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const btn = $('#formSubmit');
      btn.disabled = true;
      const original = btn.textContent;
      btn.textContent = 'Sending...';
      setTimeout(()=>{
        btn.textContent = 'Thanks — we will be in touch';
        btn.style.background = 'linear-gradient(90deg,#8fbf9b,#f2c57c)';
      }, 900);
    });

    // Set year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Chunk 4 — contact.html

Contents
- contact.html — The contact page for the aromatherapy practice site (chunk 4). This single file includes the page UI, CSS, inline unique SVG pattern, and all local JavaScript needed for the interactive features.

Features implemented
- Mood-to-Method selector: choose a mood button (Tight / Stressed, Too Wired, Foggy, Low / Heavy, Seeking Rest). The right-hand card morphs its copy (type, title, description) and the main CTA text and link update accordingly. This is implemented in pure local JS with the moodMap object.
- Pricing Comparator toggle: Monthly vs Package view with animated numeric transitions for the two example offerings (Starter Path and Deep Tune). Toggle updates the units (/mo vs /package) and animates numbers with requestAnimationFrame.
- Contact form: local demo submission handling (no backend). Includes required fields and safety-forward FAQ text about patch tests, dilution, pregnancy, and pets.
- Accessibility considerations: aria-live regions, role attributes for tablists where appropriate, focusable buttons.

Customization
- Replace placeholders in the file with real values:
  - {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
  - {{PHONE}}
  - {{EMAIL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
  - {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
  - {{CITY}}
  - {{STATE}}

Notes on assets
- A unique SVG pattern is embedded inline within contact.html for visual richness — this replaces an external assets/img/pattern.svg reference to keep the bundle self-contained.

Local testing
1. Save contact.html to a folder.
2. Open contact.html in a modern browser (Chrome, Firefox, Safari).
3. Interact with the Mood-to-Method buttons and the Pricing switch. Try submitting the form to see the local UI flow.

Safety & copy
- All language is safety-forward: uses "may support" phrasing and includes clear notes about patch testing, dilution, pregnancy, and pets.

Developer notes
- The page uses only local JS and CSS — no external fonts or CDN dependencies.
- To integrate into the full site, ensure links in the header point to existing pages (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html, contact.html).
- CTA links produced by the Mood-to-Method selector append a query parameter (e.g. ?plan=focus) to the supplied {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}. Update server-side handlers or booking links to accept these parameters if needed.

If you need the pattern extracted to a separate assets/img/pattern.svg file for reuse across pages, I can provide that as an additional file in a following chunk."}
BUNDLE_END
